quran[11]{c,v,t}:
  21,91,"And (remember Mary) who guarded her chastity. So We breathed in her Our Spirit, and made her and her son a sign for all nations."
  21,92,"Indeed, this community of yours is one community. And I am your Lord. So worship Me (alone)."
  21,93,And they fragmented their religion between themselves (into sects). All (of them) will return to Us.
  21,94,"So, whoever does righteous deeds and is a believer, there shall be no denial of his effort, and We are indeed writing (it) down for him."
  21,95,"And it is forbidden for (the people of) any town which We have destroyed (to return to the world). They shall never return,"
  21,96,"till the time when Gog and Magog are let loose and race down from every elevated place,"
  21,97,"and the true promise draws near (to its fulfilment), behold, the eyes of the disbelievers shall stare in horror, (and they will cry out:) ‘Woe to us! We have certainly been heedless to this (day)! Rather, we have been wrongdoers!’"
  21,98,"Indeed, you and what you worship besides Allah shall be the fuel of Hell. You will (all) enter it."
  21,99,"Had they been (true) gods, they would not have entered it. All of them will remain in it forever."
  21,100,"For them, there shall be groaning in it, and they shall not hear anything (else) in it."
  21,101,"Indeed, those for whom (the promise of) the best reward has gone forth from Us, it is they who will be kept away from it (i.e. Hell)."
